software included in the four executables of tukuyomi-core 0.1.0:
tukuyomi-proxy, tukuyomi-records-ship, tukuyomi-inspector and
tukuyomi-inspector-modsecurity.

Where a component is offered under a choice of licenses (for example
"MIT OR Apache-2.0"), it is used under the license shown for it in the
index.

System libraries that the executables only link dynamically and that are
not distributed with them (the GNU C Library, libgcc_s and libstdc++) are
