Part 1 is the index. It has one line per component: name, version, the
license under which the component is used, the executables that include it,
and the numbers of its texts in Part 2. Part 2 holds the license files,
copied unchanged from the package of each component, with two exceptions
marked in Part 2: CRLF line endings are converted to LF in three files, and
the notice of Jitter Entropy is taken from the comment at the top of its
source file with the comment marks removed. A text that is identical for
